    "        DeconTiffMitoFileFrame = DeconTiffMitoFileParts[0][DeconTiffMitoFileIndex+1:len(DeconTiffMitoFileParts[0])]\n",
    "        if int(DeconTiffMitoFileFrame) < 31:\n",
